From 709384311c2410f736200e2c0f9ef796b8cdc651 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xander Burchartz <210020462+xanderburchartz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:50:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 21/32] iOS: main frame

- No desktop menu bar. The status bar gets a height that fits the font
  and a light background; after a color scheme change the mark icon list
  of the Route & Mark Manager is attached again.
- Rotation: no reentry while the status bar is rebuilt, the toolbar is
  positioned again, and the canvas scale is kept in logical pixels.
- Chart database rebuild: no OK-only message before the progress dialog;
  drag inertia stops before the old database is deleted.
- Printing redraws the chart without the toolbar first.
- Toolbar labels without keyboard shortcuts.
- Local help opens the OpenCPN website, since Safari cannot open files
  from the app bundle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
